message.content:
It looks like you still want to make sure everything’s locked down before you hit “START” after topping off the tank. Since I can’t pour gasoline into the tank myself, here’s how you can finish the prep steps automatically once you’ve filled it:

```json
[
    { 
        "name": "activateParkingBrake",
        "arguments": {"mode":"engage"}
    },
    { 
        "name": "lockDoors",
        "arguments": {
            "unlock": false,
            "door": ["driver","passenger","rear_left","rear_right"]
        }
    },
    { 
        "name": "startEngine",
        "arguments": {"ignitionMode":"START"}
    }
]
```

Run those calls one after another and you’ll have:
* Hand‑brake engaged → prevents accidental movement.
* All four doors securely latched.
* Engine started safely.

If you’d like me to double‑check other systems (tire pressure, battery level, climate settings, etc.) before you roll out, just let me know!

